      "writtenOn": "2025-10-31T22:33:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, is there any issue if fsal_fd-\u003eopenflags was FSAL_O_RDWR, openflags is FSAL_WRITE and file is now read-only? We sort of should leave the file open for read. But maybe that\u0027s OK. A subsequent read will re-open the file for FSAL_O_READ (only).",
      "revId": "e999b0e1f9d34b2e6c0b402d47e5cf84866261a7",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
