        "id": 1038902
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-02T01:45:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IMO, With NFSv3, If it is a fresh write call, I think EACCES will fail before the write, so may be we won\u0027t even get into open with FSAL_O_WRITE on an existing cached fd. But, if the permission changes when a write was on going (EACCES is already done) then posix allow us to continue the write as we have already an open fd with write access, nfs-ganesha will also follow this as we do not requried to reopen.",
      "parentUuid": "d5402cdf_bf0f779e",
